OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 12 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe French cellist Gautier
OL,6,     GCapucon joins the Berlin
OL,7,     GPhilharmonic to play
OL,8,     GTchaikovsky's Variations on a
OL,9,     GRococo Theme, and the orchestra
OL,10,     Galso performs Beethoven's 2nd
OL,11,     GSymphony.
OL,12,G2145FThe Essay: David Munrow - The
OL,13,     FPied Piper
OL,14,     GIn the second episode of the
OL,15,     Gseries, Edward Blakeman reflects
OL,16,     Gon why David Munrow became a
OL,17,     Gcontroversial figure after
OL,18,     Gpopularising Early Music in the
OL,19,     G1960s and 70s.
